<header class="panel hero" style="text-align:left; padding-block: var(--space-8) var(--space-6);">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="eyebrow">Privacy Policy</p>
    <h1 style="font-size: var(--step-h2);">What This Site Collects (And What It Doesn't)</h1>
    <p class="panel__lede">Last updated {{ site.year }}. Written in plain language on purpose, the same way this whole page argues a privacy policy should be.</p>
  </div>
</header>

<section class="panel">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="a11y-list">
      <div class="a11y-list__item">
        <span class="a11y-list__tag">USES</span>
        <p>This site uses basic, aggregate web analytics: which pages get visited, roughly how people found them (referrer), and general device or browser type. It's used only to understand what's useful on this page and what isn't.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="a11y-list__item">
        <span class="a11y-list__tag">NOT</span>
        <p>No accounts, no logins, no personal profiles are built. Nothing is sold to anyone. No third-party advertising trackers are embedded on this page.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="a11y-list__item">
        <span class="a11y-list__tag">STORAGE</span>
        <p>Your dark mode preference and quiz progress live in your browser's local storage. They're never sent to a server; they just stay on your device so the setting sticks the next time you visit.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="a11y-list__item">
        <span class="a11y-list__tag">CONTACT</span>
        <p>Questions about this page or its data practices can go through <a href="https://www.creativepea.com">creativepea.com</a>.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="callout" style="margin-top: 1.5rem;">
      <p>This site is a free educational project, not a business collecting data for profit. This policy will stay this short because there genuinely isn't more to disclose. If that ever changes, this page changes with it.</p>
    </div>

    <p style="margin-top: 2rem;"><a href="/">← Back to Webpage Anatomy</a></p>
  </div>
</section>
